Package: nepalallometry
Type: Package
Title: Allometric Estimation for Nepal's Forest Trees
Version: 0.5.3.9000
Authors@R: person("Santosh", "Ayer", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "ayer.sant@gmail.com")
Author: Santosh Ayer [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Santosh Ayer <ayer.sant@gmail.com>
Description: Implements published species-specific allometric equations for
    estimating tree volume and biomass in Nepal. The initial development
    version implements total aboveground biomass equations reported by the
    Forest Research and Training Centre in 2025.
